The following elements are ported or adapted from that project:

- the seat roster and personas (orchestrator, explorer, fixer, oracle, designer,
  council, councillor, observer);
- the routing philosophy and orchestration model (plan → dispatch specialists →
  reconcile);
- the twelve skills under `skills/`;
- the multi-model council protocol.

The DeepSeek Harness integration in this repository is original work written for
